<title>UK: Argenta sets 2.0 billion Lux franc Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Argenta sets 2.0 billion Lux franc Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque et Caisse d'Epargne de l'Etat.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ARGENTA NEDERLAND NV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ARGENTA BANQUE D' ESPARGNE SA</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    09.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    09.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 100	 PRAECIPUUM  0.25</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
